{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frutiger Space</strong> is a social multiplayer game that brings the optimistic vibes of the mid 2000s internet to life. Chill with friends, ride dolphins, design your dream space, and explore a world built on Frutiger Aero aesthetics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/47a13ec2af3ca9207b621167e235ea0f.avif?t=1773347298\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space carries the spirit of early 2000s social games, with the goal of creating a place where players can <strong>connect</strong>, form new <strong>friendships</strong>, and be part of a <strong>warm</strong> and <strong>inclusive</strong> <strong>community</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/3d5a42097aea208a435733d0ca5c77ca.avif?t=1773347298\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map where every island is a tribute to a different Frutiger subgenre:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frutiger Aqua:</strong> Swim through a tropical ocean to uncover its riches!.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frutiger Eco:\u00a0</strong>Wander through lush green hills where nature and futuristic architecture exist in perfect harmony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technozen:</strong> Find your peace in cozy and serene places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plus, we are constantly adding new zones!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/794c6561d96721f0b43ea11f445aa751.poster.avif?t=1773347298\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/794c6561d96721f0b43ea11f445aa751.webm?t=1773347298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/794c6561d96721f0b43ea11f445aa751.mp4?t=1773347298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d8db09e418d1951a650d081bd5d7d2cd.avif?t=1773347298\" width=364 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your building tools and design your very own &quot;<strong>Frutiger Space</strong>&quot;! Decorate your home, invite your friends over to hang out, or travel to other players' houses to get inspired by their creativity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d14994f60965910fa64d8e8585a23ee2.avif?t=1773347298\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Webiie can be personalised with a huge selection of cosmetics. Express your personality with stylish <strong>hats</strong>\u00a0and <strong>accessories</strong>. You can purchase new things with <strong>Frutiger Orbs</strong>, which are obtained by playing minigames, completing tasks, or simply exploring the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/c5003641a6ed32fd763f7c9635f6f638.avif?t=1773347298\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space is all about <strong>fun, creativity, and relaxing with friends.\u00a0</strong>The game features a variety of minigames and activities, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dolphin Riding &amp; Racing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>House Designing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover easter eggs and a hidden story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Float with Bubbles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruit Collecting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tasks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/aa03b06f59a3a4f9b3c490fec73701f0.webp?t=1773347298\" width=350 height=19 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/995f8b9b5fa5dc0855f6bcb0a4953a0e.webp?t=1773347298\" width=350 height=19 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591510?t=1773347298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/11fd45074fa18b16270a8da4154102aad0b1ec19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773347298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/3a173567a30310afd935cc8a85081b803f8f1d3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773347298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/3a173567a30310afd935cc8a85081b803f8f1d3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773347298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"des